<title>USA: AAR gets $9.4 mln in U.S. defense contracts.</title>
<headline>AAR gets $9.4 mln in U.S. defense contracts.</headline>
<dateline>ELK GROVE VILLAGE, Ill. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>AAR Corp said Tuesday it received orders worth $9.4 million under ongoing, long-term contracts with the U.S. government.</p>
<p>The orders relate to the maintenance and overhaul of air cargo pallets and for various new cargo containers and container accessories. These products support various rapid deployment missions conducted worldwide by the U.S. Department of Defense, AAR said.</p>
<p>Manufacture and delivery of the new orders is scheduled to commence immediately, said AAR, which supplies aerospace and aviation products and services.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
